How to make these artifacts not suck?

1) This artifact also grants sickness resistance when wielded, and
#invoking this artifact toggles levitation.  Unwielding it always turns
off the levitation (watch out for bullwhips!)

2) 2d6, not 1d6, be sure it's calculated before any double damage, and
remove the non-neutral restriction on the instakill.

3) 2d8, not 1d8.  Clarify that "protection" means "AC bonus".  Remove
double damage, add immunity to brain-sucking.  While this weapon would
still kind of suck, it's now at least on a suckage level roughly
parallel to Vorpal Blade, as opposed to Trollsbane.

4) Change double damage to "living" creatures; define "living"
appropriately for monsters, excluding the obvious (Z are dead, golems
are dead, Death is dead, etc).  Up 5% chance of breaking wielded weapons
to 50% since most monsters don't last very many hits and if you didn't
break it on the first swing it may not matter.

